  {
    "RowOffset": 692114,
    "RowId": 14733,
    "Text": "Edit"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 692130,
    "RowId": 14734,
    "Text": "The portrait feature allows you to use a variety of poses, motions, and framing options to compose the perfect portrait of your character.\n\nYou may create a different portrait for each gear set, to be displayed at the beginning of certain competitive content like Crystalline Conflict PvP matches or Doman mahjong.\n\nAdditional information is available in the portrait guide, accessible from the Portraits window."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 692566,
    "RowId": 14735,
    "Text": "Gear depicted in instant portrait inconsistent with current gear set configuration."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 692662,
    "RowId": 14736,
    "Text": "If edited, portrait will change to reflect your current gear. Proceed?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 692746,
    "RowId": 14737,
    "Text": "Unable to retrieve glamour plate data. You must be in a city or sanctuary to edit or display portraits of gear sets linked to glamour plates."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 692898,
    "RowId": 14738,
    "Text": "Updated gear set does not match portrait data. You must edit this portrait in order to use it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693006,
    "RowId": 14739,
    "Text": "Current character appearance does not match portrait data. You must edit this portrait in order to use it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693126,
    "RowId": 14740,
    "Text": "A Game Master has flagged you for inappropriate content. You must edit this portrait accordingly before you may use it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693258,
    "RowId": 14741,
    "Text": "Portrait settings incompatible with current character. You must use the subcommand “Reset Default Settings” to edit and use this portrait."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693414,
    "RowId": 14742,
    "Text": "Restore Default Settings"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693450,
    "RowId": 14743,
    "Text": "Import Settings"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693478,
    "RowId": 14744,
    "Text": "Settings for all portrait elements will be copied and imported.\nSelect the portrait with settings you wish to copy.\n\n※Poses that are incompatible due to class/job will be reverted to the default."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693698,
    "RowId": 14745,
    "Text": "Source Portrait"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693726,
    "RowId": 14746,
    "Text": "Target Portrait"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693754,
    "RowId": 14747,
    "Text": "Use as Instant Portrait has been disabled, so this portrait will not automatically be applied when its gear set is equipped. Enable this function to use this image as an Instant Portrait."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 693954,
    "RowId": 14748,
    "Text": "Restore all portrait elements to default settings?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694018,
    "RowId": 14749,
    "Text": "Use as Instant Portrait"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694054,
    "RowId": 14750,
    "Text": "Use as Instant Portrait: On\nPortrait will automatically be applied as Instant Portrait when gear set is equipped."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694182,
    "RowId": 14751,
    "Text": "Use as Instant Portrait: Off\nPortrait will not be automatically applied when gear set is equipped, and Instant Portrait will reflect default settings."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694346,
    "RowId": 14752,
    "Text": "Reflect Current Gear"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694378,
    "RowId": 14753,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694390,
    "RowId": 14754,
    "Text": "Currently equipped gear will be reflected in portrait. Pose will revert to the default if current gear belongs to a different class/job."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694538,
    "RowId": 14755,
    "Text": "Confirm"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694558,
    "RowId": 14756,
    "Text": "Cancel"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694578,
    "RowId": 14757,
    "Text": "<digit(IntegerParameter(1),2)> <String>StringParameter(2)</String>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694606,
    "RowId": 14758,
    "Text": "Settings cannot be saved while performing motions."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694670,
    "RowId": 14759,
    "Text": "Import Settings from Adventurer Plate"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694718,
    "RowId": 14760,
    "Text": "All adventurer plate portrait settings will be copied and imported.\n\n※Poses that are incompatible due to class/job will be reverted to the default."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694886,
    "RowId": 14761,
    "Text": "Adventurer Plate"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694914,
    "RowId": 14762,
    "Text": "You have no gear sets saved."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 694954,
    "RowId": 14763,
    "Text": "A visual discrepancy has been detected in currently equipped gear. Please confirm that the appearance of items in the following categories are consistent with registered gear sets and glamour plates in order to ensure that your selected portrait is displayed properly:<If(IntegerParameter(1))>\nMain Hand<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(2))>\nOff Hand<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(3))>\nHead<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(4))>\nBody<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(5))>\nHands<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(7))>\nLegs<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(8))>\nFeet<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(9))>\nEars<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(10))>\nNeck<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(11))>\nWrists<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(12))>\nRight Ring<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(13))>\nLeft Ring<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(14))>\nSoul Crystal<Else/> </If><If(IntegerParameter(15))>\nFacewear<Else/> </If>"
  },
